    "detailed_description": "<strong>Numbers That Go Up!</strong><br>The Best Duck Clicker is a small and polished game about defeating those threatening beasts.<br>Upgrade your stats, destroy more ducks, unlock new ducks, repeat!<br><br><strong>Carefully balanced to be an enjoyable experience!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110500/extras/033326b82d4ad79dda305f040fbc5ff1.poster.avif?t=1735242348\" width=434 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110500/extras/033326b82d4ad79dda305f040fbc5ff1.webm?t=1735242348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110500/extras/033326b82d4ad79dda305f040fbc5ff1.mp4?t=1735242348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Includes:<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plenty of upgrades<br></li><li>35+ ducks to unlock and destroy<br></li><li>Special master ducks which provide additional bonuses<br></li><li>Quests to complete for unlocking new features and getting rewards<br></li><li>Random boost events<br></li><li>Capturing and selling ducks to gain idle income<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Rebirth system for gaining a new currency<br></li><li>Offline income</li></ul>",
